4
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.609
Welcome, Andreas.

5
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:20.760
Thanks, Andrew. I'm excited to be here
today and can't wait to show you how to use

6
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.660
Knowledge Graphs to improve your
